title: "template-rs: An opinionated and comprehensive template for building Rust packages"
abstract: |
  A Copier template for making Rust packages as a Git repository that follows our
  strongly opinionated practices for building, developing, and managing Rust
  packages. See the <a href="https://template-rs.seedcase-project.org">website</a>
  for more details.
authors:
